<title>UK: SOCCER-WALES COACH GOULD GETS TWO-YEAR EXTENSION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WALES COACH GOULD GETS TWO-YEAR EXTENSION.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wales national soccer manager Bobby Gould has had his job extended to the eve of the new millenium by the Welsh Football Association.</p>
<p>Wales are out of the running for the 1998 World Cup finals but the new contract to December 31, 1999, will cover qualifying for the next European championships in 2000.</p>
